    "text": "Microsoft Stock Charts Look Vulnerable. Software Stocks Could Follow.\nWhen Microsoft moves, the software sector tends to follow. It has one of the largest weightings in major technology indexes and the iShares Expanded Tech-Software ETF at almost 8%. As a bellwether for enterprise spending, Microsoft’s price action often shapes broader sentiment across the group.",
